  "name": "Merguez Sausages 2",
  "text": "Merguez Sausages 2\n\nIngredients\n\nFor the Sausage\n\n1 kilo ground shoulder and leg\n\n250 grams finely diced hard fat\n\n4 cloves garlic, mashed with 1 tablespoon salt\n\n1 teaspoon harissa\n\n1 tablespoon finely minced cilantro\n\n1 tablespoon merguez spice blend\n\nFor the spice blend\n\n1 part Cumin\n\n1/4 part turmeric\n\n1/8 part caraway\n\n1/6 coriander\n\n1/16 fennel\n\n1/8 dried thyme (zaatar)\n\n¼ sumac\n\n1/4 sweet paprika\n\n1/8 ancho chile powder\n\n1/4 cayenne\n\n1/32 black pepper\n\n1/32 white pepper\n\n1/32 pink pepper\n\nPreparation",
